2026-07-27T09:06:55.0498932Z i /tmp/RtmpYRsQfU/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:06:55.0499186Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:06:55.0499446Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:06:55.0499802Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:06:55.0500119Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:06:55.0500576Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:06:55.0501199Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
